SUMMARY
======================================================================================================================
  Linear: the conversion lowers sigma8(0) by 6.9% at the nominal cell (S8 0.774 on Planck 2018's normalisation)
  and by 5.0-6.9% across delta_t0 = 5.31-25; the suppression fades to 1.0% at z = 3.  Below the daughters'
  free-streaming scale the linear power drops to T^2(1, 0.5) = 0.117.
  Nonlinear: without the phantom the chain's power at k = 1, z = 0.5 is 0.11-0.52 of LCDM's across the recapture readings;
  the 1.7 Mpc phantom stand-in takes it to 0.90 (canonical) / 0.98 (alt).  Which side the chain lands on is set by the
  MOND sector's small-scale lensing, which is under repair (FP19/FP20).

  checks: 11/12 pass; load-bearing failures: 1   [186s]
